@startuml

node "School Office PC" {
    [School Management System]
    database "Local SQLite Database"
}

node "Head Teacher Laptop" {
    [Reporting Module]
}

node "Mobile Phone (4G Hotspot)" {
    [Internet Connection]
}

node "Central Education Server" {
    [Synchronization Service]
    database "Master Database"
}

[School Management System] --> "Local SQLite Database"

"School Office PC" --> "Head Teacher Laptop" :
Local Network (available during school hours)

"Head Teacher Laptop" --> "Printer" :
USB/Wi-Fi (when needed)

"School Office PC" ..> "Mobile Phone (4G Hotspot)" :
4G Connection

"Mobile Phone (4G Hotspot)" ..> "Central Education Server" :
Sync Daily when internet available

note right of "School Office PC"

When internet link is DOWN:

✓ Student registration works
✓ Attendance recording works
✓ Fee payment recording works
✓ Viewing student records works
✓ Local report generation works

Data remains stored in the
Local SQLite Database and
synchronizes later when
connectivity returns.

end note

@enduml
